        "sections": 248,
        "kept": true,
        "why": "Widely used free system design course. Adds topics the roadmap covers lightly or not at all: networking basics (IP, OSI, TCP/UDP), proxies, database indexes, normalization, consistent hashing, database federation, N-tier and microservices architecture, event sourcing, CQRS, API gateways, geohashing, circuit breakers, rate limiting, service discovery and SLAs. It also includes interview case studies (WhatsApp, Netflix, Uber)."
      },
